"local_minitalkwaitting06"="おっ!あの剣は高いんだぞ!";
"local_minitalkwaitting07"="チカラが欲しい!";
"local_minitalkwaitting08"="バカやろう!";
"local_minitalkwaitting09"="もっと早く動け!";
"local_minitalkwaitting10"="死ぬな!故郷の母親を思い出せ!";
"local_minitalkwaitting11"="友よ、時は金なりだ。";
